FX Unleashed wheel app patch

This project contains no Simagic software and no Simagic firmware, patched or not. A patch file holds only the
differences made by our own change and bytes of our own code; applying it needs the user's own copy of Simagic's
original file. Simagic's firmware and the encryption that protects it are never distributed here.

